# Projected financial statements layout

## Document title

`Projected Financial Statements (Next Five Years)`

## Print path

- In-page `window.print()` via `#financial-projection-print-root` + `body.financial-projection-printing`.
- `index.css` must exclude `.financial-projection-printing` from the default print `visibility: hidden` rule, or the page prints blank.
- Official output: `FinancialProjectionDocument` (do not clone the wizard preview).
- Excel download uses the 2024 template sheet names (Year 0, Year 1, Cash Flow, Income Statement, Balance Sheet) filled from the engine snapshot.

## Content

Income statement, cash flow, and balance sheet for Years 1–5, plus ratio summary. Freeze timestamp is metadata; hide portal chrome.
